Matter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":26,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1483133348583284738,"date":1642441520000,"rawContent":"MLK Day we commemorate, celebrate and take notice of today\u2019s truth.\n\nWe reflect on Dr. King and his dream. \n\nIn the dreams\u2019 awakening we see the real, a truth be told. \n\nThe struggle continues. \n\n@TheBlackCaucus @NAACP @JoeBiden @VP #VotingRightsAct #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/H4JI6JwAtS","userId":1030148441043816448,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/FJUl6yqXEAIJnXR?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"JohnMasonMN","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":27,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1489933538526961677,"date":1644062811000,"rawContent":"Hear ye,hear ye another Black man killed by police!\n\nSad but not surprised by the racist no knock warrant &amp; execution of #AmirLocke by the MPD\n&amp; @MayorFrey \n\nSo I guess we\u2019ll mourn, protest&amp;talk about justice again, right?\n@NAACP @JoeBiden @vp @TheBlackCaucus  #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/8XB6IkqKw8","userId":1030148441043816448,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/FK1OqBlXwAo9O_r?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/FK1OqBnXEAQAZiv?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"JohnMasonMN","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":28,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"r